{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-7","kind":"proposition","title":"线段平方与矩形面积恒等式","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut at random, the square on the whole and that on one of the segments both together are equal to twice the rectangle contained by the whole and the said segment and the square on the remaining segment.","book":2,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","contentId":"euclid-2-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ca269caa147689ffc2f215e3db58dfc4450481efc73cba8989a8dad90da2da5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-7.statement","euclid-2-7.construction.1","euclid-2-7.proof.1","euclid-2-7.construction.2","euclid-2-7.proof.2","euclid-2-7.proof.3","euclid-2-7.proof.4","euclid-2-7.proof.5","euclid-2-7.construction.3","euclid-2-7.proof.6","euclid-2-7.conclusion","euclid-2-7.historical.1","euclid-2-7.historical.2","euclid-2-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d22eb53b293c0711d266d01f9c8af9faa17f3f2481071b08f4f4193bae4414e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut at random, the square on the whole and that on one of the segments both together are equal to twice the rectangle contained by the whole and the said segment and the square on the remaining segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线随机切除,则整个正方形和其中一部分的线条加起来等于整个和上述部分组成的矩形的两倍,其余部分的正方形的两倍。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任两分之其元线上及任用一分线上两直角方形并与元线偕一分线矩内直角形二及分馀线上直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任意两平方在直线任意一半及任意一侧，并且平方二上的平方和第一分钟时刻余数的平方之和"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7481ff15bd45c2a697036d1b4544d0019a36eb9a4b02a7167dcd5f620b0dd794","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line AB be cut at random at the point C;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB线直线任意切开至C点;"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14e3a8a6093b6def01be2b0b910faebefb6564367cb44a3e24a075e5adb328b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the squares on AB, BC are equal to twice the rectangle contained by AB, BC and the square on CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,AB,BC的正方形等于AB,BC和CA的矩形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c13bb45001da9fb90ce392530ceec4e613da48a4925ada4b079f8d8ed594b7d9","citations":["euclid-1-46"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square ADEB be described on AB, [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ADEB ADEB的描述在AB上,然后绘制数字。 [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d883979cfc8de857400381b2b2f2bbf0aa14c0824b6b9fe1fae37ccd2e0f554","citations":["euclid-1-43"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AG is equal to GE, [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)] let CF be added to each; therefore the whole AF is equal to the whole CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG等于GE, 每人加CF, 因此整个AF等于整个CE。 [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e49dedff058024e7a096c6d5336dad09dde92440be652e10437031ec663c44a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AF, CE are double of AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AF,CE是AF的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcd773d213e65f6cb2816c1d637afc87d302bc1d971fd4f22a305f8d4a30d715","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AF, CE are the gnomon KLM and the square CF; therefore the gnomon KLM and the square CF are double of AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AF、CE是曲尺形、KLM和正方形,CF;因此,曲尺形、KLM和正方形,CF是AF的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1c2ee072a9d68c6454607c63a00154f3d7962e8ebc88608b8c200b08deb78ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But twice the rectangle AB, BC is also double of AF; for BF is equal to BC; therefore the gnomon KLM and the square CF are equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形 AB,BC的两倍也是AF的两倍;BF的两倍等于BC;因此,曲尺形 KLM和正方形 CF的两倍等于矩形 AB,BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"628ee3dc84589d9e77cfa7f360c64144cd5c55a5e9e0362ddd5e668232586593","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DG, which is the square on AC, be added to each; therefore the gnomon KLM and the squares BG, GD are equal to twice the rectangle contained by AB, BC and the square on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将DG,即AC的正方形,加到每张上;因此,曲尺形,KLM和正方形,BG,GD等于AB,BC和AC的矩形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b59b547cb0668b89f82f5e7c19046bdc74d2c25b1e43b50e0056b4219efb007","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the gnomon KLM and the squares BG, GD are the whole ADEB and CF, which are squares described on AB, BC; therefore the squares on AB, BC are equal to twice the rectangle contained by AB, BC together with the square on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,曲尺形 KLM和正方形 BG、GD是全部ADEB和CF,即AB和BC中描述的正方形;因此,AB和BC中的正方形和BC是AB和BC中矩形和正方形和AC中正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68180b4ac67c25d6fc02fad0785318319e9d5c33af3b0f7900411b0bdf90bd2e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任两分之其元线上及任用一分线上两直角方形并与元线偕一分线矩内直角形二及分馀线上直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任意两平方在直线任意一半及任意一侧，并且平方二上的平方和第一分钟时刻余数的平方之和"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ea187128a40e52ba1527697d9155b7c3ddb33a790d38303be496e12e7f2a10e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰试于甲乙上作甲丁直角方形次作乙戊对角线从丙作丙己线与乙丁平行遇对角线于庚末从庚作辛壬线与甲乙平行夫辛己丙壬皆直角方形〈本篇四之系〉而辛庚与甲丙等〈一卷卅四〉即辛己为甲丙上直角方形也又甲戊与甲乙等即甲己直角形在甲乙偕甲丙矩线内也又戊丁丁壬与甲乙甲丙各等即辛丁直角形亦在甲乙偕甲丙矩线内也夫甲己己壬两直角形〈即癸子丑罄折形〉及丙壬直角方形并本与甲丁直角方形等今于甲己辛丁两直角形并加一丙壬直角方形即与甲丁直角方形加一辛巳直角方形等矣则甲乙甲丙矩线内直角形二及丙乙上直角方形并与甲乙上直角方形及甲丙上直角方形并等也注曰以数明之设十数任分之为六为四如前图十之羃百及六之羃三十六并与十六互乘之两实百二十及四之羃十六等如后图十之羃百及四之羃十六并与十四互乘之两实八十及六之羃三十六等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试于甲乙上作甲丁正方形次作乙戊对角线从丙作丙己线与乙丁平行遇对角线于庚末从庚作辛壬线与甲乙平行夫辛己丙壬皆正方形〈本篇四之系〉而辛庚与甲丙等〈一卷卅四〉即辛己为甲丙上正方形也又甲戊与甲乙等即甲己矩形在甲乙与甲丙矩线内也又戊丁丁壬与甲乙甲丙各等即辛丁矩形亦在甲乙与甲丙矩线内也夫甲己己壬两矩形〈即癸子丑罄折形〉及丙壬正方形并本与甲丁正方形等今于甲己辛丁两矩形并加一丙壬正方形即与甲丁正方形加一辛巳正方形等矣则甲乙甲丙矩线内矩形二及丙乙上正方形并与甲乙上正方形及甲丙上正方形之和相等也注曰以数明之设十数任分之为六为四如前图十之平方百及六之平方三十六并与十六互乘之两实百二十及四之平方十六等如后图十之平方百及四之平方十六并与十四互乘之两实八十及六之平方三十六等"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-7.source","contentId":"euclid-2-7","revisionId":"euclid-2-7@raw-7ca269caa147689f","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3bafe3f63deb5cdb4576a87939047ca8c9bbf1ec1a4663df59fc95e31df23cb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-7:euclid-1-46:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-7.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-46","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 46"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-7:euclid-1-43:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-7.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-43","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 43"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-13:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-13.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"II. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-73:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-73","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-73.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.73","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.73/","sourceLabel":"II. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-74:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-74","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-74.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.74/","sourceLabel":"II. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-75:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-75","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-75.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","typ